    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/1ad7f069232a2b4b6952eae993e235d9.webp?t=1754955716\" data-has-big width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 500 years since the world experienced a catastrophic apocalypse, magic has begun to seep into the world. Although devastated by the event, humanity has begun harnessing this power, and is currently experiencing a golden age of human expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly graduated United City States Militia Commander, you have been tasked with heading to a new posting along the western frontier. A fast-spreading goblin infestation has taken over an old-world underground mega-facility, and you've been tasked to clear it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/f4899c44b74e704a68df892aceee2711.poster.avif?t=1754955716\" width=610 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/f4899c44b74e704a68df892aceee2711.webm?t=1754955716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/f4899c44b74e704a68df892aceee2711.mp4?t=1754955716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARKCORP, working in conjunction with the UCS Militia, has provided the operation with a cutting edge M-TEK computer, capable of administering an entire base from one machine. With this tech, the user can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read Emails </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct Shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and Sell Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and Assign Operators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Operators and deploy them into the field</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once deployed into the field, take direct control of your operator and explore the underground depths of\u300cNA-LRC/A-07\u300dan old world fortress constructed before the apocalypse . Fight hordes of creatures, dodge projectiles, and make your way towards the source of the goblin infestation in the depths below. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/c935694498b14416d801fa357ec3ecce.poster.avif?t=1754955716\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/c935694498b14416d801fa357ec3ecce.webm?t=1754955716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/c935694498b14416d801fa357ec3ecce.mp4?t=1754955716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING: Losing an operator in the field will result in them permanently dying along with total equipment loss. Careful preparation and tactical gameplay will ensure success in the field. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To combat this issue, a one-way teleportation system has been setup to allow instant extraction of operators. While this failsafe enables escape, operator safety remains dependent on proper resource management in the field.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/1ad7f069232a2b4b6952eae993e235d9.webp?t=1754955716\" data-has-big width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 500 years since the world experienced a catastrophic apocalypse, magic has begun to seep into the world. Although devastated by the event, humanity has begun harnessing this power, and is currently experiencing a golden age of human expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly graduated United City States Militia Commander, you have been tasked with heading to a new posting along the western frontier. A fast-spreading goblin infestation has taken over an old-world underground mega-facility, and you've been tasked to clear it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/f4899c44b74e704a68df892aceee2711.poster.avif?t=1754955716\" width=610 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/f4899c44b74e704a68df892aceee2711.webm?t=1754955716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/f4899c44b74e704a68df892aceee2711.mp4?t=1754955716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARKCORP, working in conjunction with the UCS Militia, has provided the operation with a cutting edge M-TEK computer, capable of administering an entire base from one machine. With this tech, the user can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read Emails </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct Shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and Sell Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and Assign Operators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Operators and deploy them into the field</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once deployed into the field, take direct control of your operator and explore the underground depths of\u300cNA-LRC/A-07\u300dan old world fortress constructed before the apocalypse . Fight hordes of creatures, dodge projectiles, and make your way towards the source of the goblin infestation in the depths below. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/c935694498b14416d801fa357ec3ecce.poster.avif?t=1754955716\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/c935694498b14416d801fa357ec3ecce.webm?t=1754955716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524050/extras/c935694498b14416d801fa357ec3ecce.mp4?t=1754955716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING: Losing an operator in the field will result in them permanently dying along with total equipment loss. Careful preparation and tactical gameplay will ensure success in the field. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To combat this issue, a one-way teleportation system has been setup to allow instant extraction of operators. While this failsafe enables escape, operator safety remains dependent on proper resource management in the field.</p>",
    "short_description": "Creature Containment is a hybrid Base Builder/Top-Down shooter. As a newly graduated Militia Commander, you're tasked with wiping out a goblin infestation that's taken root in an old-world mega facility. Manage your base, equip your operators, and fight hordes of creatures underground...",
